---
// src/components/ferreteria/CaracteristicasFerreteria.astro
---

<section id="caracteristicas" class="relative overflow-hidden py-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950 text-white">
  <!-- Luces ambientales y patrón de fondo amplio -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_2px,transparent_2px)] [background-size:40px_40px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 -left-48 h-[600px] w-[600px] rounded-full bg-purple-600/10 blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 -right-48 h-[600px] w-[600px] rounded-full bg-indigo-600/10 blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Encabezado de la sección con mayor espaciado -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-28 space-y-6">
      <span class="text-purple-400 font-extrabold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest bg-purple-500/10 px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-purple-500/20">
        Experiencia Visual Fluida
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Cada herramienta pensada para impulsar la agilidad de tu negocio
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-xl font-normal leading-relaxed px-4">
        Descubre cómo la tecnología intuitiva se adapta al ritmo de tu día a día, facilitando cada proceso con espacios amplios, claros y sin complicaciones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Rejilla en 2 Columnas Verticales (Espacios amplios y balanceados) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">

      <!-- ================= COLUMNA IZQUIERDA ================= -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 lg:gap-16">
        
        <!-- Bloque 1: Texto (Búsqueda) - Con agrandamiento en hover -->
        <div class="p-10 sm:p-14 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-500 group min-h-[380px] flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-3xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-500">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m21 21-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 1 0 5.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 10.607 10.607Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block">Atención al cliente</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-snug">Búsqueda Rápida en Mostrador</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
            Localiza cualquier artículo de manera inmediata para agilizar las filas, responder al instante a tus compradores y brindar un servicio sumamente dinámico y profesional.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloque 2: Imagen (Mostrador) - Inclinación: +2deg -->
        <div class="rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:rotate-[2deg] flex flex-col min-h-[400px]">
          <div class="bg-slate-800/90 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-700/80 shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 w-32 h-4 bg-white/10 rounded-md"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 bg-slate-950/50 flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-full h-full min-h-[300px] rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed border-purple-500/20 bg-purple-950/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-purple-300/80 p-8 text-center">
              <svg class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 stroke-current opacity-70" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-base font-medium">Espacio visual: Módulo de Mostrador</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloque 3: Texto (Compras) - Con agrandamiento en hover -->
        <div class="p-10 sm:p-14 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-500 group min-h-[380px] flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-3xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-500">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block">Gestión de compras</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-snug">Reabastecimiento Inteligente</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
            Optimiza tus adquisiciones consultando el historial detallado de precios de proveedores y recibiendo sugerencias útiles para mantener tu establecimiento siempre surtido.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloque 4: Imagen (Compras/Reabastecimiento) - Inclinación: -1.8deg -->
        <div class="rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:-rotate-[1.8deg] flex flex-col min-h-[400px]">
          <div class="bg-slate-800/90 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-700/80 shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 w-32 h-4 bg-white/10 rounded-md"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 bg-slate-950/50 flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-full h-full min-h-[300px] rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed border-purple-500/20 bg-purple-950/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-purple-300/80 p-8 text-center">
              <svg class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 stroke-current opacity-70" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-base font-medium">Espacio visual: Sugerencias y Proveedores</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ================= COLUMNA DERECHA (Con un ligero desfase superior para dinamismo) ================= -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 lg:gap-16 lg:mt-24">
        
        <!-- Bloque 5: Imagen (Inventarios) - Inclinación: -2deg -->
        <div class="rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:-rotate-[2deg] flex flex-col min-h-[400px]">
          <div class="bg-slate-800/90 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-700/80 shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 w-32 h-4 bg-white/10 rounded-md"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 bg-slate-950/50 flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-full h-full min-h-[300px] rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed border-purple-500/20 bg-purple-950/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-purple-300/80 p-8 text-center">
              <svg class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 stroke-current opacity-70" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-base font-medium">Espacio visual: Control de Inventarios</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloque 6: Texto (Existencias) - Con agrandamiento en hover -->
        <div class="p-10 sm:p-14 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-500 group min-h-[380px] flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-3xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-500">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 3 19.875v-6.75ZM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V8.625ZM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V4.125Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block">Logística interna</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-snug">Control Preciso de Existencias</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
            Lleva un registro impecable de la mercancía disponible en tu almacén, realiza traslados fluidos entre sucursales y actualiza las cantidades con total exactitud y seguridad.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloque 7: Imagen (Créditos) - Inclinación: +1.5deg -->
        <div class="rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:rotate-[1.5deg] flex flex-col min-h-[400px]">
          <div class="bg-slate-800/90 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-700/80 shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></div>
              <div class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 w-32 h-4 bg-white/10 rounded-md"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 bg-slate-950/50 flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-full h-full min-h-[300px] rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed border-purple-500/20 bg-purple-950/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-purple-300/80 p-8 text-center">
              <svg class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 stroke-current opacity-70" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-base font-medium">Espacio visual: Cuentas y Créditos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloque 8: Texto (Créditos) - Con agrandamiento en hover -->
        <div class="p-10 sm:p-14 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-500 group min-h-[380px] flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-3xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-8 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-500">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 stroke-current" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0 1 15.793 2.107c.711.121 1.358-.546 1.15-1.243a8.59 8.59 0 0 0-4.655-5.967m-3.564-3.125h3.693c1.92 0 3.52 1.488 3.657 3.407l.38 5.297m-15.347-8.694a3.75 3.75 0 1 1 7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1-7.5 0ZM4.5 20.25a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h6.75a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v.75H4.5v-.75Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 block">Administración comercial</span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-snug">Créditos y Cuentas Claras</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
            Administra de manera transparente los créditos otorgados a clientes frecuentes y constructores, facilitando estados de cuenta ordenados, comprensibles y fáciles de auditar.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>